{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name","id":1152354,"title":"A Lie by any other name...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-23T18:45:36-07:00","id":1152354,"title":"A Lie by any other name...","content":"After chatting with a friend, something picked my curiosity:<br /> <br /> What and how many Lies can we ennumerate? Some of them are pretty obvious since they're part of the Arcana purview, such as: &quot;death is not the end&quot; (Death) or &quot;distance isn't physical space&quot; (Space). Some other Lies are those embodied by the Exarchs: &quot;we must all bow down to the Natural Law&quot;.<br /> <br /> So, what other Lies can we deduct from the Arcana, the Paths, the Exarchs and other instances as per the MtAw gameline?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Historian ~ <b><a href=\"http://www.nwodbrasil.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.cronistasdastrevasbr.com</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>I currently ST a... </b>MtAW 2e campaign called &quot;Axis Mundi - Si Vis Pacem&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/250-yuukale","name":"Yuukale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T19:02:33-07:00","id":1152360,"title":"","content":"Gods other than Bull and Bird freely gifted their hearts. That\u2019s a Lie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T19:06:47-07:00","id":1152361,"title":"","content":"'' There is a material (or monetary) value for everything''. From the Mammon ... something.<br /> I'm sure there is a much better way of writing it but i cant think of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T19:26:49-07:00","id":1152369,"title":"","content":"&quot;Truth is unmutable and belongs only to Heaven&quot;-the Father's Doctrine, disproved by Prime manipulation of Truth as a concept.<br /> <br /> &quot;There is nothing special about humanity as a life form&quot;-the Raptor's Savagery, disproven by how hard it is to manipulate complex and especially sentient life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-23T21:34:03-07:00","id":1152405,"title":"","content":"I have once made a full list of each of the Exarch' Lies, in the way I see them and their influence, for a project I once wrote-<br /> <br /> Raptor- &quot;You either survive or die. You can't grow above the natural order&quot;<br /> <br /> Psychopomp- &quot;There is no way out from death. Only the worthy can move on&quot;<br /> <br /> Ruin- &quot;There is no happy ending. Everything is doomed to fail&quot;<br /> <br /> Nemesis- &quot;It is a dangerous world out there. Be afraid of the dark from within and without&quot;<br /> <br /> Prophet- &quot;Everything is a dust in the wind. History moves upon the back of the characters in the story&quot;<br /> <br /> Chancellor- &quot;Everything has a price. Life is only a coin to measure your value&quot;<br /> <br /> Eye- &quot;Fear your own secrets. You are being watched, and they would be used against you&quot;<br /> <br /> Father- &quot;Don't ask questions. The authority of faith is absolute&quot;<br /> <br /> General- &quot;Only those like you can be trusted. The others are enemies, and they will always be&quot;<br /> <br /> Unity- &quot;Identity means nothing. Everyone are the same, in body and mind&quot;<br /> <br /> Gate- &quot;Not everyone are worthy. The truth is only for the rare elite, while the rest should remain asleep&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T01:22:01-07:00","id":1152430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152360#post1152360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gods other than Bull and Bird freely gifted their hearts. That\u2019s a Lie.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's just a lie, not a Lie.<br /> <br /> Then again so are some of the the Exarchs lies, probably because they're not really the Exarchs lies and more what the Seers serving them, still caught up in the lie make of them.<br /> The Chancellor doesn't enforce the Lie that everything has a price. Sure it fits his theme and pleases him when Seers propagate that lie since it obfuscates the real issue. The real Lie here is that material objects have any influence on the supernal concept of Life at all. We need tools to live, especially human, a mountain or chasm can bar our way etc. Those are Lies.<br /> The Raptor is another easy example. It's not that you can't rise above natural law, it's the existence of it that is the Lie. At least if you listen to the Silver Ladder everytime you have to take a dump it's an insult and distraction levied at you by the Exarchs. Our biological impulses themselves are a Lie meant to distract us from higher places.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T01:39:13-07:00","id":1152436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yuukale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name#post1152354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;death is not the end&quot; (Death)</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really agree with that. It's not exactly a lie it's more a product of a limited perspective.<br /> <br /> I think the Exarchs in general tend towards that. They're truths about the world, but truths twisted to keep people asleep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T07:22:59-07:00","id":1152496,"title":"","content":"Some of these &quot;Lies&quot; sound like they would have been around before the Fall, at least for Sleepwalkers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T07:33:05-07:00","id":1152500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152496#post1152496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of these &amp;quot;Lies&amp;quot; sound like they would have been around before the Fall, at least for Sleepwalkers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering that reality got rewritten by the Fall, and has been rewritten multiple times \u201csince,\u201d this isn\u2019t an issue. For all Mages know in the Time Before people were Cthulhu-esque monstrosities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T08:19:28-07:00","id":1152513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152496#post1152496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of these &quot;Lies&quot; sound like they would have been around before the Fall, at least for Sleepwalkers.</div> </div> </div> </div>but the Fall always was, didn't it? There was never a world without the Exarchs, and there was never a universe in which the Lie didn't ruled. The reason that it looks like those lies have always been, is because they were- the world before the Lie never existed, and Atlantis has always sank in the Abyss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T08:56:48-07:00","id":1152522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152513#post1152513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but the Fall always was, didn't it? There was never a world without the Exarchs, and there was never a universe in which the Lie didn't ruled. The reason that it looks like those lies have always been, is because they were- the world before the Lie never existed, and Atlantis has always sank in the Abyss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would'nt that be another Lie?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T09:10:15-07:00","id":1152530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152522#post1152522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would'nt that be another Lie?</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering the retroactive changes rendered by messing with the Supernal, not really.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T11:41:44-07:00","id":1152572,"title":"","content":"The cognitive dissonance these Lies (the fall allways was, etc.) is simply a result that Time istelf is a Lie. All the gross Arcana only matter in the Fallen World, they're part of the Lie, absent in the Supernal. One wonders wether they are an accidental Lie, a logical mutation of the subtle Arcana in contact with the fallen World or a deliberate Lie engineered by the Exarchs to trap mages who glimpse supernal truth in the pursuit of more immediatly useful bastardized versions of the subtle Arcana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T12:06:53-07:00","id":1155157,"title":"","content":"Recently, I've had an idea for one of the Nemesis' Lies (Spirit), which is humanity's numbness to spiritual resonance. Humans are essetialists by nature - we tend to believe that an object's history and origins effect its qualities. It's why a jersey worn by a particular athlete sells for so much more than a replica, and why people are uncomfortable buying a house someone died in (well, one of the reasons).<br /> <br /> In the CoD, this instinct is well justified by ephemeral beings and resonance. Its not hard to imagine that before the Fall, humans could properly sense these, which allowed them to pay proper respects, have a proper sense of worth, and identify genuine magic. That the Spirit arcana is so fundamental yet somewhat isolated from most of the Fallen (dealing with such a specific thing as the Shadow and its denizens), could also point to it once being much more meaningful to the average person. Maybe.<br /> <br /> Blinding that sense makes humans much more easily manipulated. We can't tell what something's actual resonance is, but we believe it has some, which lets others lie to oversell us and prey on emotional needs, while also stymying the proper flow of essence to the Shadow. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Just a thing that came to mind while reading about essentialism (because CoD has entirely corrupted my thinking)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T12:19:37-07:00","id":1155160,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152513#post1152513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but the Fall always was, didn't it? There was never a world without the Exarchs, and there was never a universe in which the Lie didn't ruled. The reason that it looks like those lies have always been, is because they were- the world before the Lie never existed, and Atlantis has always sank in the Abyss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not any more, but before that it does. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T12:22:51-07:00","id":1155161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152436#post1152436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't really agree with that. It's not exactly a lie it's more a product of a limited perspective.<br /> <br /> I think the Exarchs in general tend towards that. They're truths about the world, but truths twisted to keep people asleep.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m pretty sure the Lie the Moros see through is that what is not living (whether because it died or because it never lived) is inert.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T08:04:14-07:00","id":1155392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152405#post1152405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nemesis- &quot;It is a dangerous world out there. Be afraid of the dark from within and without&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>That one sounds a bit true. Maybe something like &quot;All you can do against the world's dangers is hide from them.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T21:35:05-07:00","id":1155644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1155392#post1155392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That one sounds a bit true. Maybe something like &amp;quot;All you can do against the world's dangers is hide from them.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>On the other hand, the Exarchs are Supernal and thus True. Their Lies aren\u2019t called so because they\u2019re entirely false, but because they\u2019re warped and half-true and malicious. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m personally inclined to The Nemesis being \u201cThe flesh and the spirit are separate.\u201d That\u2019s obviously true, but only partly so. Which is why it\u2019s so insidious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T16:04:54-08:00","id":1156825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1152354-a-lie-by-any-other-name?p=1152369#post1152369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;There is nothing special about humanity as a life form&quot;-the Raptor's Savagery, <b>disproven by how hard it is to manipulate complex and especially sentient life</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>As far as I can recall, that's not actually harder than manipulating any other life in 2E.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}